From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Diego Ferigo <dgferigo@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 11:50:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] unvendor-lodepng-in-dependencies

Since 3.17.0 simulate/cmake/SimulateDependencies.cmake includes third_party_deps/lodepng,
that fetches lodepng via FetchContent_Populate, not redirected to
find_package by the dependency provider.
---
diff --git a/simulate/cmake/SimulateDependencies.cmake b/simulate/cmake/SimulateDependencies.cmake
--- a/simulate/cmake/SimulateDependencies.cmake
+++ b/simulate/cmake/SimulateDependencies.cmake
@@ -105,5 +105,5 @@
 endif()
 
 # Fetch lodepng dependency.
-include(third_party_deps/lodepng)
+find_package(lodepng REQUIRED)
 
-- 
2.43.0

